{
  "name": "proto-protoc-include-copies-vendored",
  "description": "Every file of protoc's include tree is a copy of an upstream schema: the language feature and option files of google/protobuf, which declare pb or a package below it, and google/protobuf/compiler/plugin.proto are live under schema-vendored; a file of that directory declaring another package is no copy, and its declarations are published as any others.",
